  eventID: MeetingGroupInitial
  dialogueLines:
  - "This man looks like he\u2019s in the middle of a meeting. I wonder what it\u2019s
    about."
  - "This worker appears to be talking in a meeting. Curious what they\u2019re discussing."
  - "He seems to be having a rather serious conversation. I wonder what\u2019s being
    discussed."
  - "This man looks like he\u2019s in a meeting. Whatever they\u2019re talking about
    must be important."
  - It appears this worker is in the middle of a meeting. The narrator wonders what
    it could be about.
  - "This looks like some sort of meeting. Perhaps the player shouldn\u2019t interrupt."
  - The man seems to be discussing something with his coworkers. I wonder what it
    is.
  - He looks rather busy talking with the others. This must be some kind of meeting.
  - "The worker appears to be in a meeting. Whatever they\u2019re discussing, it
    seems important."
  - "This man is clearly having a meeting. The narrator is a little curious about
    what they\u2019re talking about."
